  "recommendations": [
    "Use local capture for Discord/meetings first; use a vcvm bot only as an opt-in fallback.",
    "Keep Aqua Voice raw audio and transcripts local; publish public manifests without transcript text, raw audio, or audio paths.",
    "Use Meetily as the first-choice meeting recorder; keep Screenpipe audio as fallback/context-only when Meetily is active.",
    "If Aqua is actively used for dictation/import audio, keep Screenpipe audio as fallback-only for that capture path.",
    "Treat Cognitor/private browser sessions as a kill switch: drop private-window events and block Context Hub memory writes.",
